title: Capital Flight
subtitle: Capitalists are closing down their plants and moving assets out of the country.
new-page: true
view-if: capital_flight_progress >= 10 and capital_flight_timer = 0 and trade_marketization >= 25
on-arrival: {!
  Q.capital_flight_timer += 24;
  window.facClose('large', 0.15);
  window.facClose('medium', 0.05);
  Q.coup_progress += 2;
  Q.elites_wealth *= 0.95;
  Q.instability += 1;
!}
tags: event

= Capital Flight

Increasingly, capitalists are moving their assets out of the country. They see the economic situation in Russia as untenable, and the chaos unbearable. The inflation, strikes, and hunger all contribute to the businesses' unease.

Factories are shuttering, and industrial production is collapsing.

- @nationalize
- @takeovers
- @assuage
- @nothing


@nationalize
title: The government should seize the abandoned plants.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – We lack the resources.
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  window.facReopen('nationalized', 0.8 * Q.finalefficacy_trade, 0.3, 6);
  Q.capital_flight_progress -= 5;
  Q.elites_unrest += 10; Q.middle_unrest += 5;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 5;
  Q.workers_b += 2*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.instability += 0.5;
!}

Commissars are dispatched to the shuttered plants with orders to restart production under state management. Where the owners have stripped the machinery or emptied the accounts, there is little left to restart.


@takeovers
title: Workers must take over the factories and organize production themselves!
on-arrival: {!
  window.facReopen('syndicalized', 0.6, 0.5, 8);
  Q.capital_flight_progress -= 5;
  Q.elites_unrest += 10; Q.middle_unrest += 5;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 10;
  Q.workers_strength += 5;
  Q.workers_b += 5*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.instability += 1; 
!}

Factory committees have taken over the plants abandoned by the capitalists, and are doing their best to keep them in operation. Without engineers, credit, or suppliers, many of them struggle to do so.


@assuage
title: Can we assuage the capitalists somehow?

The capitalists demand the suppression of the factory committees and budget austerity.

- @suppress
- @austerity
- @both
- @nationalize
- @takeovers
- @nothing


@suppress
title: Suppress worker unrest with the city militias.
subtitle: Use the city militias and loyal troops if we must. This will be dangerous.
choose-if: loyal_troops_strength + city_militia_strength > workers_militia_strength
unavailable-subtitle: The city militias are not strong enough.
on-arrival: {!
  window.facReopen('large', 0.7);
  Q.capital_flight_progress -= 10;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 10*Q.unrest_modifier;
  Q.labor_unrest_timer += 4;
  Q.workers_b -= 10*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.workers_strength -= 5;
  Q.elites_unrest -= 5;
  Q.city_militia_independent += 10;
  Q.city_militia_strength *= 0.8;
  Q.workers_militia_militancy += 0.25;
  Q.instability += 1;
!}

We have given the order to suppress strikes and factory committees, with force if necessary. And force was used. This is a dark day, another Bloody Sunday, an action that one would think only the Tsars would commit.

Many members of the city militia have chosen to resign rather than take part in another action such as this.


@austerity
title: Commit to budget austerity.
choose-if: government_functions > 10
unavailable-subtitle: There is nothing left to cut.
on-arrival: {!
  window.facReopen('large', 0.4);
  Q.capital_flight_progress -= 5;
  for (var dept of ['foreignaffairs', 'military', 'enlightenment', 'internal', 'railways', 'trade', 'finance', 'justice', 'labor', 'agriculture', 'foodsupply', 'nationalities']) {
      Q[dept + '_expend'] -= 0.25;
  }
  Q.monthly_inflation -= 0.4;
  Q.workers_unrest += 2; Q.middle_unrest += 2;
  Q.workers_b -= 3*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.middle_b -= 3*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.soldiers_b -= 5*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.morale -= 0.04;
  Q.train_capacity *= 0.99;
  Q.elites_unrest -= 5;
!}

Cutting the budget hurts the workers and middle class, and also reduces the morale of the soldiers and railroad workers, two of the largest groups of government employees. This makes them less effective at their jobs.


@both
title: Suppress worker unrest and commit to budget austerity.
subtitle: This will be dangerous.
choose-if: loyal_troops_strength + city_militia_strength > workers_militia_strength and government_functions > 10
unavailable-subtitle: [? if loyal_troops_strength + city_militia_strength <= workers_militia_strength : The city militias are not strong enough. ?][? if government_functions <= 10 : There is nothing left to cut. ?]
on-arrival: {!
  window.facReopen('large', 1);
  Q.capital_flight_progress -= 10;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 10*Q.unrest_modifier;
  Q.labor_unrest_timer += 4;
  Q.workers_b -= 13*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.workers_strength -= 5;
  Q.city_militia_independent += 10;
  Q.city_militia_strength *= 0.8;
  Q.workers_militia_militancy += 0.25;
  Q.instability += 1;
  for (var dept of ['foreignaffairs', 'military', 'enlightenment', 'internal', 'railways', 'trade', 'finance', 'justice', 'labor', 'agriculture', 'foodsupply', 'nationalities']) {
      Q[dept + '_expend'] -= 0.25;
  }
  Q.monthly_inflation -= 0.4;
  Q.middle_unrest += 2;
  Q.middle_b -= 3*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.soldiers_b -= 5*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.morale -= 0.04;
  Q.train_capacity *= 0.99;
  Q.elites_unrest -= 10;
!}

We have sent in the militias to suppress the workers, and cut the government budget. This assuages the capitalists and restores their confidence in our government, but it severely hurts the government's credibility with the masses.


@nothing
title: There is nothing we can do.

There is nothing we can do.
